@WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5175

### GET all persons
GET {{WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/contacts
Accept: application/json

###
GET http://localhost:5175/api/contacts/d6ae8a07-ef76-40c5-93bf-ed5c6d5d6a2f
